WEBVTT

00:05.430 --> 00:07.050
And there we go!

00:07.050 --> 00:10.950
You're shining extra bright 
today, guardian deity!

00:12.070 --> 00:13.110
Are you all right?

00:13.110 --> 00:15.930
You don't need to come 
here every day, you know.

00:16.950 --> 00:18.990
By the way, where's Yoki?

00:18.990 --> 00:22.020
You didn't notice when he left earlier?

00:22.020 --> 00:23.620
No, not at all.

00:23.620 --> 00:27.130
He told us he was going to the castle.

00:27.130 --> 00:28.350
The castle?

00:31.850 --> 00:36.340
This is His Majesty Dartz Olta Clariness.

00:38.860 --> 00:42.070
It goes without saying that 
I have summoned you here

00:42.690 --> 00:45.560
with regard to what happened 
in the village of Dagaz.

00:46.230 --> 00:48.420
I guess all kings in this 
world are pompous asses,

00:48.420 --> 00:51.210
whether they're human or demon.

00:52.810 --> 00:54.910
Nah, that was way too stuffy!

00:55.830 --> 00:57.570
Okay if I just talk normally?

00:57.570 --> 00:59.270
It is not, Your Majesty.

00:59.270 --> 01:02.580
Aw, don't be such a stiff, Sylvia!

01:02.580 --> 01:04.390
A king must present himself with dignity.

01:02.820 --> 01:06.580
Wait, does he always act like this?

01:04.390 --> 01:06.580
C'mon, what's the problem?

01:06.860 --> 01:10.350
Oh, sorry about that. 
Let's get to the point.

01:10.970 --> 01:14.020
You guys ran off the hero 
Miller and a bunch of bandits,

01:14.020 --> 01:16.090
saving the village of Dagaz.

01:16.090 --> 01:19.310
You'll be granted an honorarium 
for your meritorious deed.

01:19.730 --> 01:22.100
In other words, you get a reward.

01:22.100 --> 01:24.920
I do not desire anything in return.

01:25.640 --> 01:28.170
I merely did what needed to be done.

01:28.170 --> 01:31.370
I see. Well, that's why 
you're Our Lady Cecilia.

01:33.730 --> 01:36.610
Well, then, Yoki, what about you?

01:37.070 --> 01:40.600
My only desire, Your Majesty,

01:40.600 --> 01:43.380
is one that you cannot grant me.

01:43.380 --> 01:47.580
My wish is one that I 
must fulfill for myself!

01:47.960 --> 01:49.990
A wish I can't grant?

01:50.390 --> 01:52.340
What is it? Money?!

01:52.340 --> 01:53.590
No.

01:53.590 --> 01:55.090
A harem?

01:55.370 --> 01:56.590
No!

01:56.590 --> 01:59.430
The royal throne?!

01:59.430 --> 02:01.800
None of these things!

02:01.800 --> 02:05.770
What is it, then?! What is it you want?!

02:05.770 --> 02:09.730
It is naught but the love of Cecilia!

02:09.730 --> 02:10.580
The love of Cecilia!

02:14.060 --> 02:14.850
Huh?!

02:21.180 --> 02:24.990
Well, you're right! I definitely 
can't give you that!

02:26.180 --> 02:28.020
Did I just say that?!

03:58.840 --> 04:00.510
I'm so sorry!

04:00.510 --> 04:03.400
That was not the place for you 
to declare your love for someone!

04:03.400 --> 04:05.620
Have you no common sense at all?!

04:05.620 --> 04:08.010
I'm sorry, seriously!

04:08.010 --> 04:10.980
That one really was all on you.

04:10.980 --> 04:12.180
I'm sorry!

04:12.980 --> 04:14.390
Honestly...

04:15.190 --> 04:17.590
You need to think about what you've done.

04:18.190 --> 04:22.190
Starting today, you are prohibited 
from seeing Cecilia for one month.

04:22.190 --> 04:23.970
What?!

04:24.300 --> 04:27.700
That's so cruel...

04:26.170 --> 04:31.150
Um... I think he already feels bad enough.

04:31.150 --> 04:33.210
Is that really necessary?

04:33.210 --> 04:37.710
What's this? Would you miss 
him for the whole month?

04:37.710 --> 04:40.170
Well, um... the thing is...

04:41.540 --> 04:43.300
Half a month, then.

04:43.300 --> 04:44.490
Happiness.

04:46.050 --> 04:48.580
Cecilia!

04:53.890 --> 04:56.130
Captain, look.

04:57.300 --> 04:59.320
Huh? Shiek?

04:59.320 --> 05:02.680
I wondered why he wasn't back 
yet. So that's where he was.

05:03.000 --> 05:04.810
He's been sad for a long time.

05:05.170 --> 05:06.920
It must be because of Miller.

05:07.860 --> 05:11.960
He really feels bad that he couldn't 
protect Teal and the gargoyle.

05:13.560 --> 05:14.970
All done.

05:17.810 --> 05:20.120
My guardian deity!

05:20.120 --> 05:22.440
Now, don't cling so closely.

05:24.310 --> 05:26.800
I'm back, Teal and Gar.

05:26.800 --> 05:28.300
"Gar"?

05:29.060 --> 05:30.920
Yeah, 'cause he's a gargoyle.

05:31.420 --> 05:33.220
We need a name for him, don't we?

05:33.220 --> 05:35.730
Oh, what a lovely name!

05:36.220 --> 05:39.240
But he'll always be the 
guardian deity to me.

05:39.240 --> 05:41.310
You're just ignoring the name I gave him?!

05:43.050 --> 05:45.490
You should be going back now.

05:45.740 --> 05:47.730
Teal, come home.

05:47.730 --> 05:49.600
Yes, you're right.

05:49.600 --> 05:52.060
I'll come again, guardian deity.

05:53.490 --> 05:55.580
Don't push yourself too hard.

05:56.230 --> 06:00.000
Well, all of my strength 
comes from you, after all!

06:06.010 --> 06:08.510
Man, I blew it.

06:08.510 --> 06:10.120
Has something happened?

06:11.380 --> 06:15.020
I got carried away, and now I'm 
banned from seeing Cecilia.

06:15.020 --> 06:16.300
I see.

06:16.710 --> 06:20.520
Then you'll just have to do whatever 
you can to make up for it.

06:20.970 --> 06:24.120
You do have plenty of time, after all.

06:28.660 --> 06:31.450
And that's why you came to see me, huh?

06:31.450 --> 06:33.310
I don't have any other choice!

06:33.310 --> 06:35.870
Kramen, you gotta give me 
as much work as you can!

06:35.870 --> 06:39.380
I want to become a man worthy of Cecilia!

06:39.380 --> 06:41.380
Okay, okay.

06:46.490 --> 06:48.200
What's wrong with me?

06:48.540 --> 06:49.800
Oh, my.

06:49.800 --> 06:53.430
Who is that other cup for?

06:53.430 --> 06:56.010
I-It's yours, Mother.

06:56.290 --> 06:57.770
Oh?

06:59.210 --> 07:01.560
It's been just about half a month.

07:01.940 --> 07:04.440
Whatever do you mean?

07:05.490 --> 07:07.840
I wonder what Yoki is up to right now.

07:07.840 --> 07:12.060
My husband told me that he seems to 
be putting in quite a lot of work.

07:12.680 --> 07:14.830
I see...

07:18.690 --> 07:20.370
I'm back!

07:21.670 --> 07:23.960
What's this, boy? Were you 
working all night again?

07:23.960 --> 07:26.870
Well, I get to see Cecilia again soon.

07:26.870 --> 07:28.440
Of course I'm fired up.

07:28.440 --> 07:29.570
I see.

07:29.570 --> 07:32.430
Well, I have something I 
need to tell you, as well.

07:32.720 --> 07:33.930
You do?

07:37.510 --> 07:39.220
What the heck are you—

07:44.610 --> 07:47.050
The wound was more serious than I thought.

07:47.050 --> 07:48.770
You're falling apart.

07:48.770 --> 07:50.860
If we don't do something...

07:51.090 --> 07:54.360
I suppose I have but a few days left.

07:54.590 --> 07:57.050
Why didn't you say anything sooner?!

07:57.050 --> 07:59.820
Saying something would not 
have made any difference.

07:59.820 --> 08:01.360
But...

08:01.360 --> 08:05.510
So I would like you to take 
care of that little girl.

08:05.510 --> 08:06.630
Teal?

08:06.630 --> 08:09.630
She has not fully overcome her illness.

08:11.130 --> 08:14.170
She could still collapse at any time.

08:14.170 --> 08:17.140
But Shiek said her condition was stable...

08:17.140 --> 08:20.970
As one who has been watching her 
since she was young, I can tell.

08:20.970 --> 08:23.140
Something has been off recently.

08:23.520 --> 08:27.170
If I fall apart now, 
she will be all alone.

08:27.170 --> 08:30.110
Okay. Just leave Teal to me.

08:30.110 --> 08:32.420
Really? Thank you.

08:32.830 --> 08:35.360
Now I can move on with no regrets.

08:35.580 --> 08:39.870
I'm still going to save 
you, though! I swear it!

08:40.280 --> 08:42.870
There is no time. You 
know it isn't possible.

08:42.870 --> 08:46.920
But this room would feel 
so lonely without you.

08:47.300 --> 08:50.340
I need you to stick 
around as a work of art.

08:57.340 --> 08:59.850
The gargoyle's body is cracking?

09:00.080 --> 09:03.350
You can fix that by feeding him magicite.

09:03.660 --> 09:05.810
What? It's that simple?

09:05.810 --> 09:07.180
Everyone knows that.

09:07.180 --> 09:09.580
What, seriously? That'll be a cakewalk!

09:09.580 --> 09:10.510
Thanks, Duke!

09:10.510 --> 09:10.900
Uh...

09:10.900 --> 09:13.860
There's more to the explanation, though...

09:16.650 --> 09:20.350
Wait, where can I get magicite, anyway?

09:20.350 --> 09:21.830
Yoki!

09:23.540 --> 09:25.460
Cecilia?

09:25.980 --> 09:28.460
Yoki, there's trouble!

09:28.460 --> 09:29.860
It's Teal!

09:37.910 --> 09:40.300
Shiek, how's she doing?

09:41.490 --> 09:42.810
It's bad.

09:43.080 --> 09:43.810
What?

09:44.440 --> 09:46.400
Her fever won't go down.

09:46.400 --> 09:49.810
Magic can't get rid of the disease itself.

09:50.110 --> 09:51.190
What can we do?

09:51.190 --> 09:53.820
She's been burning through 
her strength too quickly.

09:54.120 --> 09:56.820
The medicine we have will 
only buy her some time.

09:56.820 --> 09:59.880
Is there anything I can do?

09:59.880 --> 10:03.240
I'm short on herbs. I 
need some twilight grass.

10:03.680 --> 10:04.890
Twilight grass?

10:05.250 --> 10:08.750
It's a flowering plant that only 
grows in magic-rich places.

10:09.080 --> 10:11.270
It doesn't grow in Minerva.

10:11.590 --> 10:12.650
How can we...

10:12.650 --> 10:14.910
Okay, leave it to me. I'll look for some.

10:15.300 --> 10:17.780
In that case, I'll help you.

10:17.780 --> 10:20.790
Thanks. I'd really appreciate the help.

10:20.790 --> 10:22.290
There's still Gar, too.

10:22.290 --> 10:23.260
Gar?

10:23.760 --> 10:27.250
Has... something happened 
to the guardian deity?

10:27.250 --> 10:28.690
Teal!

10:28.690 --> 10:30.690
Don't. You need to stay in bed.

10:35.390 --> 10:36.650
Captain.

10:36.650 --> 10:40.160
I'll keep an eye on Teal. 
You can count on me.

10:40.890 --> 10:41.660
Okay.

10:45.350 --> 10:47.500
Where can we buy magicite?

10:47.500 --> 10:51.460
The merchants' guild should 
sell valuable materials.

10:51.460 --> 10:53.430
Let's try there, then.

10:55.410 --> 10:57.810
U-Um, this was all my idea!

10:57.810 --> 10:59.930
Mother! Yoki was just...

10:59.930 --> 11:03.440
Don't worry. I know you're 
concerned for Teal.

11:03.440 --> 11:04.490
Y-Yes.

11:04.490 --> 11:06.950
Don't you need to hurry? Off you go, now.

11:08.140 --> 11:09.370
Thank you!

11:13.440 --> 11:15.400
You're all out of magicite?!

11:15.400 --> 11:16.940
No twilight grass, either?!

11:16.940 --> 11:20.900
I'm very sorry. Both are in short supply.

11:21.240 --> 11:22.740
You're kidding me...

11:24.620 --> 11:25.870
Hey. Good to go?

11:26.200 --> 11:29.830
Kramen, sir! The quest form is all done.

11:32.790 --> 11:35.870
Oh, Yoki. Perfect timing.

11:35.870 --> 11:36.750
Nope.

11:36.750 --> 11:38.610
I didn't even ask you yet.

11:38.930 --> 11:41.030
You want me to 
take a quest, don't you?

11:41.030 --> 11:42.550
I don't have time for that.

11:43.300 --> 11:45.950
You need magicite and 
twilight grass, right?

11:45.950 --> 11:46.650
Huh?

11:47.010 --> 11:52.260
This quest is for the removal of a 
monster hiding out in a magicite mine.

11:53.180 --> 11:56.370
And that's not all. Magic power 
accumulates in that mine,

11:56.370 --> 11:58.450
so twilight grass grows there naturally.

11:58.450 --> 11:59.480
Really?!

12:00.120 --> 12:02.060
You'll help me out, right?

12:08.820 --> 12:11.820
I can't believe it took two 
days to get to the mine.

12:11.820 --> 12:15.180
Only two days. You said 
you were in a hurry,

12:15.180 --> 12:17.700
so I arranged an express carriage for you.

12:17.700 --> 12:20.940
Thank you for your help as well, Sophia.

12:20.940 --> 12:23.270
When one of our maids is in danger,

12:23.270 --> 12:26.930
the head maid can't very 
well stand idly by.

12:34.380 --> 12:36.230
We finally made it.

12:36.900 --> 12:40.700
We shall head for the mine tomorrow, 
once all preparations are made.

12:40.700 --> 12:44.350
Tomorrow? We can't just go now?

12:44.350 --> 12:46.630
The monsters are more active at night.

12:46.630 --> 12:48.910
The one we're after will 
be even more of a threat.

12:49.230 --> 12:51.650
Is this thing really that nasty?

12:51.650 --> 12:55.920
It's a rock eater that chowed down 
on magicite until it mutated.

12:56.500 --> 12:58.700
So not only is it even more savage now,

12:59.070 --> 13:03.430
but it's also highly resistant 
to attack magic.

13:03.980 --> 13:06.430
Sorta like Miller's magic sword, I guess.

13:06.680 --> 13:11.970
And the client wants someone 
to bring back this jolly little

13:11.970 --> 13:14.430
mutant rock eater's hide unharmed.

13:14.430 --> 13:17.770
So we can't just brute-force it this time.

13:17.770 --> 13:19.080
I have a plan.

13:19.440 --> 13:21.960
Even if attack magic doesn't work,

13:22.500 --> 13:25.320
it's still possible to 
restrain it with magic.

13:28.460 --> 13:30.620
Shall we get moving, then?

13:30.620 --> 13:32.070
In your maid uniform?!

13:32.070 --> 13:34.780
Will you be all right in that?

13:34.780 --> 13:38.070
This is proper, order-made battle attire.

13:38.070 --> 13:39.080
Huh...

13:39.320 --> 13:43.550
My husband says he likes the 
way I look in a maid uniform.

14:08.450 --> 14:10.340
Is that the rock eater?

14:10.340 --> 14:13.450
Damn, it's eating magicite like 
it's just a crunchy snack.

14:27.010 --> 14:27.720
Dear!

14:28.300 --> 14:28.990
On it!

14:35.560 --> 14:37.020
Don't underestimate us!

14:44.610 --> 14:46.370
That didn't do a thing!

14:46.370 --> 14:48.670
Hey, don't damage the hide.

14:48.670 --> 14:49.820
Yeah, I know!

14:57.470 --> 14:59.460
We need to get him to hold still first!

14:59.460 --> 15:01.460
Earth Lock!

15:02.470 --> 15:04.920
I'll help! Saint Chains!

15:13.600 --> 15:15.100
How is it so strong?!

15:18.490 --> 15:20.610
Well, what now, Kramen?

15:20.610 --> 15:22.750
I'll cover Sophia with shikigami

15:22.750 --> 15:25.440
so she can go in through its 
mouth and kill it from inside.

15:26.580 --> 15:28.230
Isn't that too dangerous?!

15:28.230 --> 15:30.940
Close-range combat is my specialty.

15:30.940 --> 15:33.470
My woman's the best there is.

15:33.470 --> 15:36.410
Okay, I see! How about this, then?

15:46.510 --> 15:48.200
Well done, Yoki!

15:53.390 --> 15:56.380
All right, that big mouth's open now!

15:58.770 --> 16:00.280
Leave this to me.

16:08.940 --> 16:11.400
Quit flailing!

16:19.580 --> 16:20.830
It split itself up?!

16:20.830 --> 16:22.080
What?!

16:23.550 --> 16:24.630
Kramen!

16:24.630 --> 16:27.320
Just hold out for one more minute, milady!

16:27.320 --> 16:28.040
All right!

16:29.960 --> 16:31.970
Keep still!

16:35.180 --> 16:36.390
Take this!

16:39.930 --> 16:43.620
Damn! Magic doesn't work 
on those guys, either?

16:43.620 --> 16:45.020
Well, then...

16:48.980 --> 16:50.900
how about some of this?!

16:53.280 --> 16:55.720
Hey! At least try to protect yourself!

16:55.720 --> 16:58.280
Keeping my shikigami up takes priority!

16:58.280 --> 17:01.290
And go easy on the smitten husband thing!

17:05.120 --> 17:07.580
Not... yet!

17:12.340 --> 17:13.510
Cecilia!

17:41.200 --> 17:43.700
You're not hurt, are you, Sophia?

17:43.700 --> 17:46.310
No. I'm just fine.

17:47.210 --> 17:48.720
They're such lovebirds.

17:48.720 --> 17:50.210
They sure are.

17:50.210 --> 17:52.790
All right, now get off of me.

17:53.540 --> 17:56.210
We still need to find the twilight grass.

17:56.590 --> 17:57.710
Oh, right!

18:13.190 --> 18:14.780
Yoki! This is it!

18:15.110 --> 18:17.430
So this is twilight grass, huh?

18:25.540 --> 18:27.470
We need to hurry back to Minerva.

18:28.130 --> 18:31.440
It's too dangerous to drive at night.

18:31.440 --> 18:33.000
We'll leave in the morning.

18:33.000 --> 18:35.110
Aw, we'll be fine!

18:35.110 --> 18:37.990
Yoki, I understand how you feel,

18:37.990 --> 18:39.470
but please bear with it this time.

18:49.950 --> 18:51.820
Maid uniform...

18:51.820 --> 18:54.070
Quietly...

19:00.590 --> 19:01.540
Cecilia—

19:01.550 --> 19:02.170
Shh.

19:02.790 --> 19:05.870
There's twilight grass in here.

19:06.430 --> 19:08.710
Sophia is sound asleep.

19:09.050 --> 19:11.220
You should be able to fly to Minerva now.

19:11.540 --> 19:13.880
Okay. I'm impressed you knew, though.

19:15.560 --> 19:17.630
I was sure you'd try to go anyway.

19:17.630 --> 19:19.160
Really?

19:19.160 --> 19:21.140
Take care of those two.

19:21.140 --> 19:23.670
I will. Leave it to me.

19:26.010 --> 19:27.100
Well, I'm off.

19:47.160 --> 19:48.750
Hey, wake up, Gar!

19:52.420 --> 19:55.670
It can't be... Was I too late?

19:55.670 --> 19:58.290
Come on, you little-girl-loving statue!

19:58.290 --> 20:02.840
I'm not gonna let you lead that innocent 
little girl on and then just die!

20:04.910 --> 20:08.680
What has... happened to Teal?

20:08.940 --> 20:10.680
She's gonna be fine.

20:11.160 --> 20:12.740
Shiek's taking care of her.

20:13.660 --> 20:16.310
I see. That's good.

20:16.310 --> 20:20.130
So you need to hurry up and 
eat this magicite, too.

20:20.130 --> 20:23.570
I'm gravely wounded. A 
little magicite cannot—

20:23.570 --> 20:25.910
You never know until you try!

20:25.910 --> 20:29.910
Or, what? Do you wanna make poor Teal sad?

20:29.910 --> 20:33.790
She's fighting her illness 
because she believes in you!

20:34.420 --> 20:36.710
What's that? A claw?

20:36.710 --> 20:37.780
Teal...

20:38.380 --> 20:42.310
Well, all of my strength 
comes from you, after all!

20:42.670 --> 20:45.160
Right... I...

20:49.560 --> 20:51.850
My body burns!

20:55.210 --> 20:58.310
This must be what they call a miracle!

20:58.310 --> 20:59.830
Awesome!

20:59.830 --> 21:00.930
I'm going now!

21:01.900 --> 21:04.120
Whoa, wait, Gar!

21:14.140 --> 21:14.990
Teal!

21:17.530 --> 21:20.170
Guardian... deity?

21:20.450 --> 21:21.850
You're all right.

21:22.670 --> 21:27.180
Damn. And I need to get 
back to Cecilia by morning.

21:27.180 --> 21:28.880
I'm so glad, though.

21:28.880 --> 21:31.190
Yes. It's all thanks to you.

21:31.190 --> 21:32.190
Me?

21:32.190 --> 21:34.700
Both last time and now,

21:35.170 --> 21:37.620
you protected me and Teal.

21:37.620 --> 21:38.690
Thank you.

21:42.890 --> 21:45.110
Good job, Shiek.

21:46.430 --> 21:49.070
Guardian deity, your arm!

21:49.500 --> 21:53.080
Worry not. That bad dream is over now.

21:54.710 --> 21:55.510
Okay!

22:05.300 --> 22:07.500
What's up with Yoki?

22:07.500 --> 22:09.520
He seems particularly exhausted.

22:09.520 --> 22:12.250
Yoki did work very hard.

22:12.580 --> 22:16.050
Mrmph... Cecilia...

22:19.210 --> 22:20.590
This is his reward.
